msgstr "The grey tree tricked me! I should have done the opposite."

msgid "Gri kristale vur, parlasın! Kıskaç'ın gölü en dipte."
msgstr "Hit a grey crystal so it shines! Pinch's lake is at the very bottom."

msgid "Gri kristale vurursan yeniden parlar!"
msgstr "Hit a grey crystal and it will shine again!"

msgid "Gri kristallere vur!"
msgstr "Hit the grey crystals!"

msgid "Gri kristallere vur, parlasınlar!"
msgstr "Hit the grey crystals so they shine!"

msgid "Gökkuşağı"
